36596.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":292,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-05 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":70,"name":"Bilet","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":292}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1621,"name":"Ksi\u0119ga pustyni ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Czternastoletnia Sun wyrusza na Sahar\u0119, by rozwik\u0142a\u0107 sekret starej legendy opowiadanej przez dziadka. Na miejscu poznaje prawdziwe losy ch\u0142opca, kt\u00f3ry w wieku dw\u00f3ch lat zagin\u0105\u0142 podczas pot\u0119\u017cnej burzy piaskowej. Pozostawiony na pastw\u0119 pustyni, zostaje cudownie ocalony przez stado strusi. Sp\u0119dza z nimi nast\u0119pne dziesi\u0119\u0107 lat, ucz\u0105c si\u0119 jak przetrwa\u0107 i dorastaj\u0105c z dala od ludzi. Jego najlepszym przyjacielem i towarzyszem zabaw jest fenek - wielkouchy pustynny lisek. Ch\u0142opiec uczy si\u0119 komunikowa\u0107 ze zwierz\u0119tami, a dzika natura staje si\u0119 jego domem. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o niezwyk\u0142ej wi\u0119zi, kt\u00f3ra potrafi narodzi\u0107 si\u0119 nawet w najbardziej nieoczekiwanych miejscach.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1785936596.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":5,"name":"Sala widowiskowo-kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"P\u0142o\u0144sk","city_id":350,"zip":"09-100","addresse":"ul. P\u0142ocka 50"}},"12430":{"id":12430,"title":"Niebo nad Normandi\u0105 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/niebo-nad-normandia-2026-09-30-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1785936754.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":292,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-05 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":70,"name":"Bilet","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":292}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1622,"name":"Niebo nad Normandi\u0105 ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">72 godziny przed l\u0105dowaniem w Normandii, losy \u015bwiata maj\u0105 zale\u017ce\u0107 od... pogody. Wojna to nie tylko bitwy, to w szczeg\u00f3lno\u015bci strategie i decyzje, kt\u00f3rych skutki odczu\u0107 mog\u0105 miliony. Pracuj\u0105cy dla brytyjskiej armii meteorolog <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/James+Stagg-2869814\" title=\"James Stagg\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">James Stagg<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Andrew+Scott-61258\" title=\"Andrew Scott\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Andrew Scott<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) musi podj\u0105\u0107 najwa\u017cniejsz\u0105 decyzj\u0119 w swojej karierze \u2013 prognoza, kt\u00f3r\u0105 przedstawi, mo\u017ce przes\u0105dzi\u0107 o sukcesie lub kl\u0119sce najwi\u0119kszej operacji wojskowej w historii. Zamkni\u0119ty w atmosferze nieufno\u015bci i presji ze strony najwy\u017cszych dow\u00f3dc\u00f3w, Stagg toczy psychologiczn\u0105 walk\u0119 z czasem, wspierany jedynie przez kapitan <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kay+Summersby-393342\" title=\"Kay Summersby\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kay Summersby<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kerry+Condon-136125\" title=\"Kerry Condon\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kerry Condon<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). Nad wszystkim czuwa genera\u0142 <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dwight+D.+Eisenhower-210712\" title=\"Dwight D. Eisenhower\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dwight D. Eisenhower<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Brendan+Fraser-5137\" title=\"Brendan Fraser\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Brendan Fraser<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), kt\u00f3ry musi zdecydowa\u0107 czy ruszy\u0107 z inwazj\u0105, czy j\u0105 op\u00f3\u017ani\u0107 \u2013 ryzykuj\u0105c, \u017ce Niemcy odkryj\u0105 plany aliant\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1785936754.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":5,"name":"Sala widowiskowo-kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"P\u0142o\u0144sk","city_id":350,"zip":"09-100","addresse":"ul. P\u0142ocka 50"}},"12410":{"id":12410,"title":"Resident Evil ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/resident-evil-2026-09-30-20-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1785936212.png","date":"2026-09-30T20:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":292,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 19:15:00","startAt":"2026-08-05 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 20:15:00"},"products":[{"id":70,"name":"Bilet","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":292}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1619,"name":"Resident Evil ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Awaria laboratorium Umbrelli powoduje niekontrolowane uwolnienie wirusa. Mieszka\u0144cy Raccoon przemieniaj\u0105 si\u0119 w bezlitosne, krwio\u017cercze istoty. Bryan, przypadkowy \u015bwiadek katastrofy, zostaje uwi\u0119ziony po\u015br\u00f3d chaosu miasta.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1785936212.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":5,"name":"Sala widowiskowo-kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"P\u0142o\u0144sk","city_id":350,