.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788524095.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":5,"name":"Sala widowiskowo-kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"P\u0142o\u0144sk","city_id":350,"zip":"09-100","addresse":"ul. P\u0142ocka 50"}},"12500":{"id":12500,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-11-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788524368.jpg","date":"2026-10-11T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":288,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-11 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-04 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-11 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":70,"name":"Bilet","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":288}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1624,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marcin+Doroci%C5%84ski-42489\" title=\"Marcin Doroci\u0144ski\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marcin Doroci\u0144ski<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kamila+Urz%C4%99dowska-2638609\" title=\"Kamila Urz\u0119dowska\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kamila Urz\u0119dowska<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marek+Kondrat-253\" title=\"Marek Kondrat\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marek Kondrat<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788524368.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":5,"name":"Sala widowiskowo-kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"P\u0142o\u0144sk","city_id":350,"zip":"09-100","addresse":"ul. P\u0142ocka 50"}},"12501":{"id":12501,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-11-19-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788524368.jpg","date":"2026-10-11T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":292,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-11 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-04 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-11 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":70,"name":"Bilet","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":292}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1624,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https